+# Keyboard contribution attribution
+
+The app framework and original input adapter are from CardputerZero/Template,
+revision 477fa6d217b683e3084c361a757f03dc8ca9f753, MIT licensed.
+Preserve the repository LICENSE and existing M5Stack copyright headers.
+
+The decoder, expanded adapter and regression foundation were adapted from
+Prophet60191/m5stack-cardputer-zero-mesh-app at
+c51a45ee61813bf9685766f9f45c95e6778780a5, MIT-licensed files only.
+Copyright 2026 Jose Di Lenola and M5Stack Technology CO LTD as marked in sources.
+No GPL radio, firewall, daemon or supervisor component is included.
+
+The 32 symbol assignments and independent fixture come from M5Stack's system
+keymap and launcher cp0_keyboard_keymap.c at
+4c05b444cb977cb90e2f33eb4c8261226e370713. See tests/fixtures/README.md for the
+unmodified fixture hash and provenance. The official map was already correct.
+
+The optional editor, Template integration and additional focus/navigation/poll
+regressions are MIT licensed. LVGL and other linked dependencies retain their
+own notices. The example accepts only synthetic/local text and does not persist it.
